NHGRI, National Human Genome Research Institute (https://www.genome.gov/). 
Top 7 lead SNPs were highlighted in bold italic with red marks in 89 genomic regions with significant associations (p < 5 x 10-8) with height using LD (r2 < 0.2). 
Abbreviations: SNP, single nucleotide polymorphism; GWAS, genome-wide association study; No., number; Chr., chromosome; 95% CI, 95% confidence interval; LD, linkage disequilibrium. 
